{"review_id": "c2a6cd9f-c4ad-4171-aefe-2f83db3c1a4a", "package": "todo.list.tasks.planner.calendar.reminder", "app_name": "To-do list - tasks planner", "language": "az", "language_name": "az", "rating": 5, "text": "It would be nice if the \"To do when I have free time\" section is added to the main page of the application. Everything else is very good👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻. Thanks for answering my question.", "author": "Qədir Mikayılov", "date": "2023-03-03T05:44:11Z", "thumbs_up": 3, "app_version": "0.2.7", "developer_reply": "Hello. In the application's Task Lists section, tap a category and swipe it to the side. A pencil and a basket will appear. Click on the pencil and edit the data. There you can turn on the visibility of the category. Click on the basket and delete the category."}
